    Curve points land on rebalance boundaries, so the measured span is the
    nearest rebalance at or before the target, not exactly 30/365 days --
    long rebalances bi-monthly, so its "1M" window can span well over 30
    days. Naming the actual from-dates and the as-of date here (rather than
    only in the chips' title tooltips) means the reader never has to take
    "1M"/"12M" on faith. Filled by renderHorizonStats() (index.html.j2) on
